<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
  <title>Copilot Studio Capacity Request</title>
  <!--
    TD Bank branded email template — Copilot Studio Capacity Request notification
    Built for Power Automate "Send an email (V2)" — table-based layout, all styles
    inline, so it renders correctly in Outlook desktop, Outlook web, and mobile.

    HOW TO USE:
    1. Replace every {{Placeholder}} with dynamic content from your form/Dataverse trigger.
    2. Replace LOGO_URL_HERE with a hosted URL to the official TD Bank white logo.
    3. Replace APPROVE_LINK_HERE with the link to your approval item / admin app.

    TD Bank brand color used: Green #12412a (with neutral grays/whites as accents)
    Copilot accent gradient (aurora): #2AA7EE > #4E8CF7 > #7A6BF5 > #A45BE8 > #CC52CF > #EE5FA0
    Gradient bars are built from solid-color table cells so they render in Outlook desktop,
    which strips CSS linear-gradient. Chips use a solid purple fallback behind the gradient.
  -->
</head>
<body style="margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f2f3f5; font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif;">

  <!-- Preheader (hidden preview text in inbox) -->
  <div style="display:none; font-size:1px; color:#f2f3f5; line-height:1px; max-height:0; max-width:0; opacity:0; overflow:hidden;">
    New Copilot Studio capacity request from {{RequesterName}} — {{AgentName}} ({{Environment}})
  </div>

  <!-- Outer wrapper -->
  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color:#f2f3f5;">
    <tr>
      <td align="center" style="padding:24px 12px;">

        <!-- Email card -->
        <table role="presentation" width="640" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:640px; max-width:100%; background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:8px; overflow:hidden; border:1px solid #d0d3d4;">

          <!-- ===== HEADER: TD Green banner ===== -->
          <tr>
            <td style="background-color:#12412a; padding:20px 32px;">
              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                <tr>
                  <td align="left" style="vertical-align:middle;">
                    <img src="LOGO_URL_HERE" alt="TD Bank" height="36" style="height:36px; width:auto; display:block; border:0;">
                  </td>
                  <td align="right" style="vertical-align:middle; color:#cfe0d3; font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.5px;">
                    EMPLOYEE ENABLEMENT | POWER PLATFORM
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- ===== Accent bar: Copilot aurora gradient (Outlook-safe segmented cells) ===== -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:0;">
              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                <tr>
                  <td width="16.6%" style="background-color:#2AA7EE; height:4px; line-height:4px; font-size:0;">&nbsp;</td>
                  <td width="16.6%" style="background-color:#4E8CF7; height:4px; line-height:4px; font-size:0;">&nbsp;</td>
                  <td width="16.6%" style="background-color:#7A6BF5; height:4px; line-height:4px; font-size:0;">&nbsp;</td>
                  <td width="16.6%" style="background-color:#A45BE8; height:4px; line-height:4px; font-size:0;">&nbsp;</td>
                  <td width="16.6%" style="background-color:#CC52CF; height:4px; line-height:4px; font-size:0;">&nbsp;</td>
                  <td width="17%" style="background-color:#EE5FA0; height:4px; line-height:4px; font-size:0;">&nbsp;</td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- ===== TITLE BLOCK ===== -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:28px 32px 8px 32px;">
              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                <tr>
                  <td>
                    <!-- Status badge -->
                    <span style="display:inline-block; background-color:#e6a817; color:#ffffff; font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:12px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:1px; padding:4px 12px; border-radius:12px;">NEW REQUEST</span>
                    <!-- Copilot chip (gradient with solid fallback for Outlook) -->
                    <span style="display:inline-block; background-color:#7A6BF5; background-image:linear-gradient(90deg, #4E8CF7, #A45BE8, #EE5FA0); color:#ffffff; font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:12px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:1px; padding:4px 12px; border-radius:12px; margin-left:6px;">&#10024; COPILOT STUDIO</span>
                  </td>
                  <td align="right" style="font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:13px; color:#6b6d70;">
                    Ref: {{RequestID}}
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
              <h1 style="margin:16px 0 4px 0; font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:24px; font-weight:bold; color:#12412a;">
                Copilot Studio Capacity Request
              </h1>
              <p style="margin:0 0 8px 0; font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#333333; line-height:1.6;">
                Submitted by <strong>{{RequesterName}}</strong> on {{SubmittedDate}}
              </p>
              <p style="margin:0 0 8px 0; font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#333333; line-height:1.6;">
                Thanks for submitting a Power Platform request. Request <strong>{{RequestID}}</strong> is ready for technical review by the Platform Team.
              </p>
              <p style="margin:0 0 8px 0; font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:13px; color:#6b6d70; line-height:1.6;">
                Note: there is a 10-business-day SLA for completion of this request.
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- ===== REQUEST DETAILS TABLE ===== -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:16px 32px 8px 32px;">
              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;">
                <tr>
                  <td colspan="2" style="background-color:#12412a; color:#ffffff; font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-weight:bold; padding:10px 14px; border:1px solid #6b6d70;">
                    Request Details
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td width="38%" style="font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#12412a; font-weight:bold; padding:10px 14px; border:1px solid #6b6d70; background-color:#ffffff;">Agent Name</td>
                  <td style="font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#333333; padding:10px 14px; border:1px solid #6b6d70; background-color:#ffffff;">{{AgentName}}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td style="font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#12412a; font-weight:bold; padding:10px 14px; border:1px solid #6b6d70; background-color:#eef2ee;">Environment</td>
                  <td style="font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#333333; padding:10px 14px; border:1px solid #6b6d70; background-color:#eef2ee;">{{Environment}}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td style="font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#12412a; font-weight:bold; padding:10px 14px; border:1px solid #6b6d70; background-color:#ffffff;">Business Owner</td>
                  <td style="font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#333333; padding:10px 14px; border:1px solid #6b6d70; background-color:#ffffff;">{{BusinessOwner}}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td style="font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#12412a; font-weight:bold; padding:10px 14px; border:1px solid #6b6d70; background-color:#eef2ee;">Department</td>
                  <td style="font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#333333; padding:10px 14px; border:1px solid #6b6d70; background-color:#eef2ee;">{{Department}}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td style="font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#12412a; font-weight:bold; padding:10px 14px; border:1px solid #6b6d70; background-color:#ffffff;">Cost Center</td>
                  <td style="font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#333333; padding:10px 14px; border:1px solid #6b6d70; background-color:#ffffff;">{{CostCenter}}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td style="font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#12412a; font-weight:bold; padding:10px 14px; border:1px solid #6b6d70; background-color:#eef2ee;">Audience</td>
                  <td style="font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#333333; padding:10px 14px; border:1px solid #6b6d70; background-color:#eef2ee;">{{Audience}}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td style="font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#12412a; font-weight:bold; padding:10px 14px; border:1px solid #6b6d70; background-color:#ffffff;">Generative / Agentic Features</td>
                  <td style="font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#333333; padding:10px 14px; border:1px solid #6b6d70; background-color:#ffffff;">{{GenerativeFeatures}}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td style="font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#12412a; font-weight:bold; padding:10px 14px; border:1px solid #6b6d70; background-color:#eef2ee;">Estimated Credits / Month</td>
                  <td style="font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#333333; padding:10px 14px; border:1px solid #6b6d70; background-color:#eef2ee;"><strong>{{EstimatedCredits}}</strong></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td style="font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#12412a; font-weight:bold; padding:10px 14px; border:1px solid #6b6d70; background-color:#ffffff;">Start Date / Duration</td>
                  <td style="font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#333333; padding:10px 14px; border:1px solid #6b6d70; background-color:#ffffff;">{{StartDateDuration}}</td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- ===== BUSINESS JUSTIFICATION CALLOUT ===== -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:16px 32px 8px 32px;">
              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                <tr>
                  <td style="border-left:4px solid #3c7a52; background-color:#eef4ee; padding:14px 18px;">
                    <p style="margin:0 0 6px 0; font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-weight:bold; color:#12412a;">Business Justification</p>
                    <p style="margin:0; font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#333333; line-height:1.6;">{{BusinessJustification}}</p>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- ===== CTA BUTTON ===== -->
          <tr>
            <td align="center" style="padding:24px 32px 8px 32px;">
              <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                <tr>
                  <td align="center" style="background-color:#12412a; border-radius:6px;">
                    <a href="APPROVE_LINK_HERE" target="_blank" style="display:inline-block; padding:12px 36px; font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:15px; font-weight:bold; color:#ffffff; text-decoration:none;">
                      Review Request
                    </a>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
              <p style="margin:12px 0 0 0; font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:12px; color:#6b6d70;">
                Please review within 10 business days. Capacity is allocated once approved.
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- ===== NEXT STEPS ===== -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:16px 32px 24px 32px;">
              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                <tr>
                  <td style="border-top:1px solid #d0d3d4; padding-top:16px;">
                    <p style="margin:0 0 6px 0; font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-weight:bold; color:#3c7a52;">&#10024; What happens next</p>
                    <p style="margin:0; font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:13px; color:#333333; line-height:1.7;">
                      1. The Employee Enablement | Power Platform team reviews the request and sizing estimate.<br>
                      2. If approved, credits are allocated to the target environment in the Power Platform admin center.<br>
                      3. The requester and business owner receive a confirmation email with the allocation details and review date.
                    </p>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- ===== Copilot aurora gradient bar above footer ===== -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:0;">
              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                <tr>
                  <td width="16.6%" style="background-color:#2AA7EE; height:3px; line-height:3px; font-size:0;">&nbsp;</td>
                  <td width="16.6%" style="background-color:#4E8CF7; height:3px; line-height:3px; font-size:0;">&nbsp;</td>
                  <td width="16.6%" style="background-color:#7A6BF5; height:3px; line-height:3px; font-size:0;">&nbsp;</td>
                  <td width="16.6%" style="background-color:#A45BE8; height:3px; line-height:3px; font-size:0;">&nbsp;</td>
                  <td width="16.6%" style="background-color:#CC52CF; height:3px; line-height:3px; font-size:0;">&nbsp;</td>
                  <td width="17%" style="background-color:#EE5FA0; height:3px; line-height:3px; font-size:0;">&nbsp;</td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- ===== FOOTER ===== -->
          <tr>
            <td style="background-color:#12412a; padding:16px 32px;">
              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                <tr>
                  <td style="font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:12px; color:#cfe0d3; line-height:1.6;">
                    Employee Enablement | Power Platform &nbsp;|&nbsp; © TD Bank<br>
                    <span style="display:inline-block; margin-top:4px; font-size:12px; color:#cfe0d3;">
                      &#10024; Powered by Microsoft Copilot Studio
                    </span><br>
                    <span style="display:inline-block; margin-top:6px; font-weight:bold; font-size:13px; color:#ffffff; letter-spacing:0.3px;">
                      THIS IS AN AUTOMATED MESSAGE. DO NOT REPLY TO THIS MESSAGE.
                    </span>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>

        </table>
        <!-- /Email card -->

      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <!-- ============================================================
       OPTIONAL: Power Platform product logo strip (commented out)

       To use: paste the <tr>...</tr> block below INSIDE the email
       card table (e.g. just above the aurora gradient bar / footer),
       then replace each *_LOGO_URL_HERE with a hosted PNG of the
       official Microsoft product icon (48x48 or 96x96 recommended).

       Official product icon colors, for reference:
         Power Apps       - purple  #742774
         Power Automate   - blue    #0066FF
         Dataverse        - green   #088142
         Copilot Studio   - aurora gradient (blue/purple/pink)

  <tr>
    <td align="center" style="padding:16px 32px; border-top:1px solid #d0d3d4;">
      <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
        <tr>
          <td align="center" style="padding:0 14px;">
            <img src="POWERAPPS_LOGO_URL_HERE" alt="Power Apps" width="32" height="32" style="display:block; border:0; margin:0 auto 4px auto;">
            <span style="font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:11px; color:#6b6d70;">Power Apps</span>
          </td>
          <td align="center" style="padding:0 14px;">
            <img src="POWERAUTOMATE_LOGO_URL_HERE" alt="Power Automate" width="32" height="32" style="display:block; border:0; margin:0 auto 4px auto;">
            <span style="font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:11px; color:#6b6d70;">Power Automate</span>
          </td>
          <td align="center" style="padding:0 14px;">
            <img src="DATAVERSE_LOGO_URL_HERE" alt="Dataverse" width="32" height="32" style="display:block; border:0; margin:0 auto 4px auto;">
            <span style="font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:11px; color:#6b6d70;">Dataverse</span>
          </td>
          <td align="center" style="padding:0 14px;">
            <img src="COPILOTSTUDIO_LOGO_URL_HERE" alt="Copilot Studio" width="32" height="32" style="display:block; border:0; margin:0 auto 4px auto;">
            <span style="font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:11px; color:#6b6d70;">Copilot Studio</span>
          </td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </td>
  </tr>
  ============================================================ -->

</body>
</html>
